IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-employee`

-- Employment Act 1968 (with the Employment (Retrenchment Reporting) Notification 2019) -- the employee's questions,
-- worked cases.
--
-- SEAT: the employee. Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here
-- has been checked against a decided case or against regulations (none were deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which facts are set (scratchpad gen_employment-act-1968_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text; several are the hand-checked values of the first-pass
-- encoding (naive-2026-10), re-derived here against the deposited text.

